# AudioWRT-owned packages that genuinely require OpenWrt source dependency traversal.
#
# Packages NOT listed here are still compiled when they contain AudioWRT source
# code, but they are built with NO_DEPS=1 against the exact-release SDK staging
# area. Runtime-only OpenWrt dependencies must never be rebuilt just because an
# AudioWRT package references them.
#
# Keep this list limited to packages whose build really needs external source
# dependencies or host tooling (for example Rust/GLib/DBus stacks).

librespot
audiowrt-bluez-libs
audiowrt-bluez
audiowrt-btctl
bluez-alsa
